{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有中學生懷疑在校園內吸食電子煙，教育局指十分關注事件。</p><p></p><p>網上流傳片段，見到多名中學女生在廁所內自拍，期間有人取出懷疑電子煙吸食。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SMOKE-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026msyHaNWkRX1794404569.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>保良局姚連生中學回覆查詢時指，十分關注相關影片，已約見有關家長及作嚴肅跟進。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SMOKE-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268PDltkBemf1794404654.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SMOKE-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261WSNrmaV3H1794404670.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>教育局指已即時聯絡學校，知悉校方已啟動危機處理機制，嚴肅跟進事件，並提醒學校加強建立學生正確價值觀及行為。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:39:38.031360+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:16:03.054525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:33:00.594243+00:00","content_hash":"d60bd2f2004511b010c48c85d65f108288fbc6a7687da2d8796bcfb7b6079a09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}